{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this retro-inspired, pixel art visual novel, a workplace friendship begins to unravel.</strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow two coworkers as their connection deepens, blurs, and ultimately breaks. Set during a painful chapter of life, Messy Hearts explores mental health, trauma, blurry boundaries, and the complicated ways people can hurt each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892820/extras/622b2baf8b1398e5cc2b40a78555463b.avif?t=1760716195\" width=192 height=192 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Florence and Their Messy Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Florence, a game dev, parent, and lonely person trying to stay afloat in a life already full of stress and vulnerability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a married coworker starts offering unexpected friendship, Florence finds comfort in their growing connection. Their friendship slowly twists into something painful and disorienting, and a slow-motion collision unfolds that they both pretend not to see coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an all-too-common story, told through fictional characters, and inspired by painful relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892820/extras/f1950e84131395f7c6eaeef5541c10ad.apng?t=1760716195\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892820/extras/f1950e84131395f7c6eaeef5541c10ad.poster.avif?t=1760716195\" class=\"bb_img\" width=192 height=192 /></picture></span> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Messy Hearts</i> is a linear, single-player narrative with no branching paths or choices. Told in a comic book-style format with pixel art, the game invites players to click through Florence\u2019s memories like pages of a journal, a text thread, or a conversation snippet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no quick-time events, puzzles, or branching choices for this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892820/extras/a30934634cb15683aa2448e207f31021.avif?t=1760716195\" width=1600 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3892820?t=1760716195","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892820/084c3ab918f52b2ece36db98b99499d6d8752bce/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760716195","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892820/a23dbe38f88f32edf88208803ed1cfc91d19c538/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760716195","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892820/a23dbe38f88f32edf88208803ed1cfc91d19c538/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760716195","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description"